dns-rs (0.6.9) unstable; urgency=low

  * Log local-zone decisions at debug level, including the matched zone,
    policy reason, query name/type, and outcome, so sinkholed names are
    traceable.

  -- Chandan Ghosh <ckghosh1983@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:36:59 +0000

dns-rs (0.6.8) unstable; urgency=high

  * Validate answer RRsets in negative DNSSEC responses that carry CNAME
    chains, so unsigned answers cannot inherit a secure denial proof.
  * Treat secure DS NODATA at a non-delegation as bogus instead of insecure.
  * Honor deny_non_local and refuse_non_local for cache hits and block
    non-local queries before they can be answered.
  * Restrict relaxed glue to A/AAAA records that match delegated NS names.
  * Rotate rate-limit and concurrency eviction scans past the fixed prefix.

  -- Chandan Ghosh <ckghosh1983@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:30:00 +0000

dns-rs (0.6.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Relax QNAME minimisation after an intermediate NXDOMAIN so wildcard names
    below empty non-terminals are not cached as false negatives.
  * Preserve strict minimisation and full-QNAME negative answers, with
    regression tests for both paths.

  -- Chandan Ghosh <ckghosh1983@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:50:11 +0000

dns-rs (0.6.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship zones.d/local-zones.conf with transparent defaults for common router
    and SOHO local domains, keeping localhost on its built-in local answer.
  * Unify the packaged control socket path at /run/dns-rs/dns-rs.sock.
  * Exercise the implemented reload command in the control smoke test.

  -- Chandan Ghosh <ckghosh1983@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:33:31 +0000

dns-rs (0.6.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bound upstream connection pools by RLIMIT_NOFILE and raise the packaged
    service's soft descriptor limit to 65536.
  * Warn at startup when a low descriptor limit reduces pool capacity.

  -- Chandan Ghosh <ckghosh1983@gmail.com>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:34:35 +0000

